WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.264
Last month, Karim and his girlfriend Élodie went to Lyon for two days. They took the train in Paris on Saturday morning and arrived two hours later.

00:00:09.514 --> 00:00:26.849
First, they left their bags at the hotel. Then they visited Old Lyon, with its little streets and old houses. At noon, they ate in a bouchon, a restaurant typical of the city. Karim loved the meal, but Élodie found the food a little too heavy.

00:00:27.099 --> 00:00:35.829
In the afternoon, it started to rain. They didn't stay outside: they went to the Musée des Confluences and spent three hours there.

00:00:36.079 --> 00:00:51.526
On Sunday, the weather was fine. They walked up to the Basilica of Fourvière. From up there, they saw the whole city. 'It's the best view of the weekend!' said Élodie. In the evening, they went back to Paris, tired but happy.
